    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to present this Landmark 4/5 bedroom Period Property on a generous c.0.42-acre site on Kinnegad’s main street. Boasting many historical features, this wonderful property is presented in good solid condition and has undergone refurbishment works to include dry-lining and updating of plumbing system."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "First Floor accommodation comprises of:\r\nBedroom 1: 11’6” x 10’1” with built in closet.\r\nDressing Room: 10’4” x 6’11” situated just off Bedroom 1, with hotpress.\r\nBedroom 2: 16’4” x 11’3” with tiled fireplace and walk-in wardrobe (7’9” x 5’11”).\r\nBedroom 3: 18’11” c 12’11” including en-suite with w/c, whb and electric shower.\r\nBedroom 4: 19’ x 9’3” large double room.\r\nBathroom: 16’9” x 4’10” with w/c, whb, bath and hotpress."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- A large gravel rear yard with side access, four newly constructed sheds, and a rear walled garden.\r\n- Double-glazed windows, a comprehensive intruder alarm.\r\n- Excellent location steps from all local amenities to include: Medical Centre, shops, supermarkets, library, GAA facilities, coffee shops/restaurants, schools, bus stops, etc.\r\n- Dublin less than an hour.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer\r\nPlease note that these particulars are for guidance only and do not form any part of contract. While care has been taken in their preparation, we do not hold ourselves responsible for any inaccuracies that may occur. They are issued on the understanding that all negotiations will be conducted through this firm."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: Exempt"
      }
